== 04:01:27 1/8 arm under a policy that stands 45 s: it will have expired when the attack comes, and the trigger must be declined on the record
== 04:09:15 the primary's last word: wait for it to finish, take the final replica, stop pulling
== 04:09:17 2/8 a policy allowing at most 1 s of lost state: declined on the record
== 04:09:26 3/8 a policy quarantining a day: no genome checks out, declined on the record
== 04:09:46 4/8 a good policy under an operator stop (stop list serial 2, everything): the chip verifies, the release is denied on the record
== 04:09:57 5/8 a policy pinning another machine as the standby (the primary's measurement): the chip verifies, the release is denied on the record
== 04:10:18 6/8 a good policy, the newest bundle corrupted in the replica: generation 1 set aside on the record, generation 0 restored
== 04:10:40 7/8 the spent policy again: refused at the door
== 04:10:51 8/8 a policy signed by a stranger: refused at the door
